# Clone stamp and recolor.
doc 140 100
pattern 11
tool Clone Stamp
set brush 11
drag L 80 50 100 70 4
dump clone-nosource
down 20 20 L C
drag L 70 40 120 80 10
dump clone
sel-rect 0 0 70 100
down 100 10 L C
drag L 30 60 60 90 6
dump clone-sel
sel-none
tool Recolor
fg 0000FF
bg FF0000
set tolerance 40
set brush 15
drag L 0 0 140 100 20
dump recolor
fg 00FF00
drag R 0 100 140 0 10
dump recolor-right
undo
dump recolor-undo
